 provide great space for family, guests, or a home office. Located on the first floor, this condo offers convenient access with no stairs. Situated near US-192 and Poinciana Boulevard, this property is close to shopping, dining, entertainment, golf, major roadways, and Central Florida's world-famous attractions. The well-maintained community offers amenities including a sparkling pool, clubhouse, fitness center, sauna, tennis courts, playground, and more. Whether furnished or unfurnished, this condo is move-in ready and offers an excellent long-term rental opportunity in the heart of Kissimmee. Schedule your showing today!","age_restricted":false,"income_restricted":false,"flags":[],"min_rent":1600,"images":[{"url":"https://ap.rdcpix.com/e8865e32ac20238b09773267ade6944el-m3978958265r.jpg","title":null,"tags":["house_view","porch","back_side","incomplete","exterior"],"primary":true,"origins":[{"kind":"primary"},{"kind":"listing"},{"kind":"api_gallery"}],"source_urls":["https://ap.rdcpix.com/e8865e32ac20238b09773267ade6944el-m3978958265s.jpg","https://ap.rdcpix.com/e8865e32ac20238b09773267ade6944el-m3978958265r.jpg"],"resolution_source":"API size:MAX"},{"url":"https://ap.rdcpix.com/e8865e32ac20238b09773267ade6944el-m2122410277r.jpg","title":null,"tags":["closet","unknown"],"primary":false,"origins":[{"kind":"listing"},{"kind":"api_gallery"}],"source_urls":["https://ap.rdcpix.com/e8865e32ac20238b09773267ade6944el-m2122410277s.jpg","https://ap.rdcpix.com/e8865e32ac20238b09773267ade6944el-m2122410277r.jpg"],"resolution_source":"API size:MAX"},{"url":"https://ap.rdcpix.com/e8865e32ac20238b09773267ade6944el-m2400988046r.jpg","title":null,"tags":["living_room"],"primary":false,"origins":[{"kind":"listing"},{"kind":"api_gallery"}],"source_urls":["https://ap.rdcpix.com/e8865e32ac20238b09773267ade6944el-m2400988046s.jpg","https://ap.rdcpix.com/e8865e32ac20238b09773267ade6944el-m2400988046r.jpg"],"resolution_source":"API size:MAX"},{"url":"https://ap.rdcpix.com/e8865e32ac20238b